A NOTE ON THE NoDerivatives CLAUSE

Chosen deliberately, to prevent reuploads and repacks, which is the practical
risk for a published mod.

It has a cost worth naming: ND also stops another modder adapting this code, and
during development this project was itself blocked from building on a
CC BY-NC-ND mod for exactly that reason — only publicly documented engine API
facts were used from it, and none of its code. Anyone in that position here
should ask; see above.
